# ==================================================================
#  MODS FOR PLAYING WITHOUT THE LAUNCHER (index.html in a browser)
#  With SnakeGame.exe, each save has its own mods: choose them in the
#  saves window (Edit > Mods), and this file isn't read.
#
#  One mod per line, as its folder inside mods/: content/<name> or
#  cosmetic/<name>. Remove the # in front to turn one on, put it back
#  to turn it off, then reload (F5).
# ==================================================================
# content/example-pack
# content/wandering-smith
# cosmetic/crt-extreme
# cosmetic/dev-stats
